==Northern Sami==

===Etymology===
From {{proto|Finno-Ugric|ńeljä|lang=se}}. Cognates include Estonian {{term|neli|lang=et}}, Finnish {{term|neljä|lang=fi}}, and Hungarian {{term|négy|lang=hu}}.

